--- !u!114 &-1690813825159798082
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 9
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: JC_V.1/9
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Eh.../nVera.../nComo alcalde, pude ver la escena antes de que llegara a
    o\xEDdos de la prensa./nReconozco que el cad\xE1ver no se parec\xEDa a nada que
    hubiera visto antes./nLo \xFAltimo que quiero es que cunda el p\xE1nico colectivo"
  childrenIDs:
  - JC_V.1/11
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 1846
    y: -1
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: -5099292496197868168, guid: 2309dcb67cafec142b50b17f300824ff, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-1338797127801241426
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 4
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: JC_V.1/4
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "Imposible./nEl muchacho apareci\xF3 reseco como una hoja.../n\xA1Eso es
    la lepra de toda la vida de Dios!/nO, al menos, eso es lo que necesito que los
    aldeanos piensen."
  childrenIDs:
  - JC_V.1/6
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: 790
    y: -7
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 1169903235430975718, guid: 2309dcb67cafec142b50b17f300824ff, type: 3}
--- !u!114 &-1247333345274539369
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a710203670c9fa140b55d5de41d5d82b, type: 3}
  m_Name: 1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  uniqueID: JC_V.1/1
  isPlayerSpeaking: 0
  text: "El pueblo est\xE1 envuelto en caos./nAparece un ni\xF1o muerto y todo el
    mundo pierde la cabeza./n\xBFSe puede creer que los aldeanos piensan que la causa
    es alguna clase de objeto m\xE1gico?/nNo puedo perder el tiempo con est\xFApidas
    supersticiones."
  childrenIDs:
  - JC_V.1/2
  - JC_V.1/3
  rect:
    serializedVersion: 2
    x: -10
    y: 124
    width: 300
    height: 200
  faithCost: 0
  RepIglesiaCost: 0
  RepPuebloCost: 0
  SobornoCost: 0
  reactionPenitent: {fileID: 0}
